      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = x^{3} + 4 x + 12 \\). Find the value of c in the open interval \\( (3, 6) \\) at which the instantaneous rate of change of f equals the average rate of change of f over \\( \\left[3, 6\\right] \\). Give the exact value.",
